  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I've been playing VR chat for about 3 years and it's sad that when I go to public worlds the annoying people are vote kicking random people that haven't done anything that leads to drama,the vote to kick needs to be reworked so when people initiated a vote kick we can see who initiated the vote and a list of reasons why they are being kicked,and when someone vote kicks someone people will don't know who the person is and just click yes and the victim gets kicked for no reason and can't rejoin in an hour,even I was getting kicked for no reason and it's annoying.please rework the vote to kick!",
